<kind>U</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-60022383-Y2" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>60022383</doc-number><kind>Y2</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1087447A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHINAGA HIROKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ROHM CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHINAGA, HIROKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ROHM CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHINAGA HIROKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHINAGA, HIROKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A light-emitting semiconductor chip comprises a substrate (2) having a pair of electrodes (3, 4), and one electrode (3) includes a pad (3a) on which an LED element (1) is mounted. The LED element (1) is enclosed in an opening (6c), wider outside than inside, defined in a reflector (6) by a wall (6Z) and filled with transparent resin.  The wall (6Z) consists of a plurality of inclined reflectors (P, Q) stacked on the substrate (2), and the angle of inclination of each reflector is such that its middle portion reflects light vertically.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne une puce à semiconducteur photoémettrice comprenant un substrat (2) pourvu d'une paire d'électrodes (3, 4) dont l'une (3) comporte une pastille (3a) sur laquelle est monté un élément DEL (1). L'élément DEL (1) est contenu dans une ouverture (6c), plus large à l'extérieur qu'à l'intérieur, formée par une paroi (6Z) dans un réflecteur (6) et remplie de résine transparente. Cette paroi (6Z) consiste en un groupe de plusieurs réflecteurs (P, Q) empilés sur le substrat (2), l'angle d'inclinaison de chaque réflecteur est tel que sa partie centrale réfléchit la lumière verticalement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>